- `{{IS_NEW:30}}` : {{IS_NEW:30}} ("new" if within N days, empty otherwise)
- `{{DESCRIPTION}}` :{{DESCRIPTION}} (page description)
- `{{KEYWORDS}}` : {{KEYWORDS}} (page keywords)
- `{{OGP_IMAGE}}` : {{OGP_IMAGE}} (page thumbnail / OGP image URL)
- `{{PAGE_URL}}` : {{PAGE_URL}} (full URL of the page)
- `{{SITE_URL}}` : {{SITE_URL}} (site root URL)
- `{{SITE_NAME}}` : {{SITE_NAME}} (site title)
- `{{SITE_DESCRIPTION}}` : {{SITE_DESCRIPTION}} (site-wide description)
- `{{SITE_OGP_IMAGE}}` : {{SITE_OGP_IMAGE}} (site-wide OGP image URL)

