## Image tag: `{{IMAGE:imageFileName}}`

```
Example: {{IMAGE:mikanBox.jpg}} — displays mikanBox.jpg
```

Just specify the filename — you don't need to worry about the path.

### Categories and images

When you upload an image while filtered to a category, the category name is automatically added as a filename prefix (e.g. blog_mikanBox.jpg).
This lets you keep images organized by category as you work. However, the prefix isn't added if the filename already starts with "_".

