## Navigation (list-style page listing): NAV_LINKS

### All pages: `{{NAV_LINKS:all}}`

Displays the page list ordered by "sort order." Pages with a value below 0 are not shown.
The current page gets the `.active` class, so you can hide it or highlight it. Here it's highlighted in bold red.

```
Example: {{NAV_LINKS:all}}
```

{{NAV_LINKS:all}}

