## Card-style page listing: NAV_CARDS

### All pages: `{{NAV_CARDS:all}}`

Ordered by "sort order"; pages below 0 are not shown.
The current page gets the `.active` class, so you can hide it or highlight it. Here it's highlighted with an orange border.

```
Example: {{NAV_CARDS:all}}
```

{{NAV_CARDS:all}}

---

### Filtered by category: `{{NAV_CARDS:category}}`

```
Example: {{NAV_CARDS:sample}} — only the "sample" category
```

{{NAV_CARDS:sample}}

