## Defining a database

### `{{DATAROW:rowID}}　{{DATA:key}}value{{/DATA}}　{{/DATAROW}}`

```
Example:
{{DATAROW:menu1}}          : think of "menu1" as a spreadsheet row
{{DATA:ITEM}}Pasta{{/DATA}}  : defines ITEM=Pasta
{{DATA:PRICE}}1200{{/DATA}}  : defines PRICE=1200
{{/DATAROW}}

{{DATAROW:menu2}}          : think of "menu2" as a spreadsheet row
{{DATA:ITEM}}Soup{{/DATA}}   : defines ITEM=Soup
{{DATA:PRICE}}700{{/DATA}}   : defines PRICE=700
{{/DATAROW}}
```

